␀␀␀␀sending a web page␀␀<a href='#firmware'>Firmware</a>␀␀␀␀(saved â€” leave blank to keep)␀AIzaâ€¦␀ open␀␀␀ (saved &#10003;)␀␀␀ (needed for Twitch channels)␀␀␀ minute␀ minutes␀␀␀␀paste the token here␀␀␀␀ style='display:none'␀␀␀ required␀␀␀Password␀␀␀␀New PIN␀Choose a PIN (4â€“12 characters)␀␀␀␀Leave blank to keep the current PIN␀e.g. 4 digits␀␀␀<h1>&#9654; SubCounter settings</h1><p>Saved on the board only. v14.6␀␀␀ &middot; <a href='/'>&larr; Dashboard</a>␀␀</p><nav class='jump'><a href='#channels'>YouTube</a><a href='#twitch'>Twitch</a><a href='#display'>Display</a><a href='#alerts'>Alerts</a><a href='#phone'>Phone</a><a href='#weather'>Weather</a><a href='#home'>Home Assistant</a><a href='#spotify'>Spotify</a><a href='#motion'>Motion</a><a href='#wifi'>Wi-Fi</a><a href='#updates'>Updates</a><a href='#security'>Security</a>␀␀</nav>␀␀<div style='background:#3a1210;border:1px solid #e62117;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:14px'><b>Couldn't connect to Wi-Fi:</b><br>␀<form method='POST' action='/save'>␀<label>YouTube channels (one per line)</label>␀␀<textarea name='channels' autocapitalize='off' autocorrect='off' spellcheck='false' placeholder='@yourchannel&#10;@mkbhd&#10;@veritasium'>␀␀</textarea>␀<small>@handles, UCâ€¦ channel IDs or channel links. Put your own channel first â€“ it's highlighted and shown on the night clock.</small>␀␀<label>YouTube Data API key</label>␀<input name='apikey' autocapitalize='off' autocomplete='off' placeholder='␀␀'><small>Only needed if you follow YouTube channels.</small>␀␀␀␀<label>Twitch channels (just the name, one per line)</label>␀␀␀␀<textarea name='twch' autocapitalize='off' autocorrect='off' spellcheck='false' style='min-height:90px' placeholder='shroud&#10;pokimane'>␀␀<small>Type the name as it appears in their Twitch address (twitch.tv/<b>name</b>). Pasting the full link works too. YouTube and Twitch together: up to 10 channels.</small>␀␀␀␀<details␀␀␀␀><summary>Twitch app details␀␀␀␀<small>Create a free app at <a href='https://dev.twitch.tv/console/apps' target='_blank'>dev.twitch.tv/console</a>: Register Your Application &rarr; any unique name &rarr; OAuth Redirect URL <code>https://localhost</code> (any https address works, it isn't used) &rarr; Category: Other &rarr; Client type: Confidential &rarr; Create &rarr; Manage &rarr; copy the Client ID and a <b>New Secret</b>. Your Twitch account needs two-factor sign-in turned on.</small>␀␀␀<label>Client ID</label><input name='twid' autocapitalize='off' autocomplete='off' value='␀␀<label>Client Secret</label><input name='twsec' type='text' class='secret' autocapitalize='off' autocomplete='off' spellcheck='false' placeholder='␀Display␀display␀<label>Colour theme</label><select name='theme'>␀␀␀␀</select><small>Accent colour on the board and the dashboard.</small>␀␀␀<label>Screen brightness: <b id='bv'>␀␀␀%</b></label><input type='range' name='bright' min='10' max='100' step='5' value='␀␀' oninput="bv.textContent=this.value+'%'" style='padding:0'>␀␀␀␀<label>Night clock brightness: <b id='nv'>␀␀%</b></label><input type='range' name='nbright' min='1' max='40' value='␀␀␀␀' oninput="nv.textContent=this.value+'%'" style='padding:0'>␀␀␀␀Switch channels automatically every 10 seconds␀␀Estimated live counts between YouTube's rounded steps (â€œest.â€)␀␀Show estimated earnings on the dashboard (YouTube)␀␀Â£ pounds␀␀␀$ dollars␀␀␀â‚¬ euros␀␀␀<div class='row'><select name='earnCur'>␀␀␀␀</select><input name='earnLo' type='number' step='0.01' min='0' value='␀' title='Low'><span>to</span><input name='earnHi' type='number' step='0.01' min='0' value='␀' title='High'></div>␀␀␀<small>Earnings per 1,000 views, low to high. YouTube doesn't publish what channels earn, so the dashboard shows a range worked out from views (like Social Blade). Typical is about 0.20 to 3.50; narrow it if you know a channel's real rate.</small>␀<label>Show the big clock after this long without use</label><select name='idleclk'>␀␀␀␀Never␀␀␀</select><small>Touch, press BOOT or pick the board up to go back.</small>␀␀<label>Night clock (dims and shows the time)</label><div class='row'>␀␀␀<span>to</span>␀<label>Subscriber race</label><div class='row'>␀<span>vs</span>␀<div id='rpv' class='rpv'></div><script>const PI={yt:"<svg width='20' height='14' viewBox='0 0 20 14'><rect width='20' height='14' rx='4' fill='#ff0033'/><path d='M8 4v6l5-3z' fill='#fff'/></svg>",tw:"<svg width='16' height='16' viewBox='0 0 16 16'><path d='M2 1h13v9l-4 4H8l-2 2H4v-2H1V4z' fill='#9146ff'/><path d='M7 4h1.5v4H7zM10.5 4H12v4h-1.5z' fill='#fff'/></svg>"};function racePv(){const f=n=>{const o=document.querySelector("select[name="+n+"]").selectedOptions[0];return o&&o.value!='-1'?'<span>'+PI[o.dataset.p]+' '+o.textContent.replace(/</g,'&lt;')+'</span>':'<span style=\'color:#777\'>None</span>'};document.getElementById('rpv').innerHTML=f('raceA')+'<em>vs</em>'+f('raceB')}racePv()</script>␀<small>Swipe down twice from the main count to see it.</small>␀␀Alerts␀␀alerts␀␀Confetti for milestones (bigger milestones, bigger party)␀␀␀Alert when a channel goes live (and switch to it)␀␀␀<label>Daily summary on the board (a monthly recap on the 1st)</label>␀␀<small>Shows for 10 minutes at this time; touch to close it. It's also on the dashboard all day, and on the board any time: long-press &rarr; swipe left &rarr; <b>Summary</b>.</small>␀<small>New-subscriber, overtake and record alerts are always on. Alerts are skipped at night, when the board is face-down, and while Spotify is playing.</small>␀␀␀␀Phone notifications␀phone␀␀␀<small>Get alerts on your phone with the free <b>ntfy</b> app (iPhone and Android, no account needed). Install it, tap <b>+</b>, subscribe to the topic below, then save.</small>␀␀␀subcounter-␀<label>ntfy topic (blank = off)</label><input name='ntfy' autocapitalize='off' autocomplete='off' spellcheck='false' value='␀␀␀␀' placeholder='e.g. ␀␀␀␀<small>Anyone who knows the topic name can read it, so make it hard to guess.</small>␀␀␀<details><summary>Own ntfy server (advanced)</summary><label>Server address</label><input name='ntfysrv' autocapitalize='off' value='␀␀␀'></details>␀␀␀␀<button type='submit' class='b2' formaction='/ntfy/test' formnovalidate>Send a test notification</button>␀␀␀<label>Town or city</label><input name='wxtown' value='␀' placeholder='e.g. Glasgow'>␀␀␀<small>Long-press the board's screen and pick Weather. Forecasts from Open-Meteo.</small>␀␀␀home␀␀␀␀<small>Room temperature and humidity from sensors in your Home Assistant (Matter, Zigbee, Thread &ndash; anything HA shows). Make a token in Home Assistant: click your name (bottom left) &rarr; <b>Security</b> &rarr; <b>Long-lived access tokens</b> &rarr; <b>Create token</b>. A separate, non-admin HA user for the board is safest.</small>␀<p style='color:#ff453a'>␀␀␀<p class='ok'>Connected &#10003;</p>␀␀␀␀<label>Home Assistant address</label><input name='haurl' id='haurl' value='␀' autocapitalize='off' autocomplete='off' spellcheck='false' placeholder='http://192.168.1.20:8123'>␀␀␀␀<small>Use the IP address and port you open Home Assistant with (usually <b>:8123</b>), not homeassistant.local.</small>␀␀␀␀<label>Long-lived access token</label><input name='hatoken' id='hatoken' type='text' class='secret' autocapitalize='off' autocomplete='off' spellcheck='false' placeholder='␀␀␀␀<button type='button' class='b2' onclick='haFind()'>Find sensors</button><small id='hamsg'></small>␀<datalist id='hadt'></datalist><datalist id='hadh'></datalist>␀␀<style>.har{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin:4px 0 14px}.har .nm{grid-column:1/3}.har input{margin:0}</style>␀␀<div class='har' id='har␀␀␀␀><input class='nm' name='han␀␀␀␀' placeholder='Room ␀␀␀␀ name, e.g. Lounge' value='␀'><input name='hat␀␀' list='hadt' autocapitalize='off' spellcheck='false' placeholder='Temperature sensor' value='␀␀'><input name='hah␀␀' list='hadh' autocapitalize='off' spellcheck='false' placeholder='Humidity sensor' value='␀'></div>␀␀␀␀<button type='button' class='b2' onclick='haMore()'>+ Add a room</button>␀␀␀<small>Clear a room's sensors to remove it. Long-press the board's screen and pick <b>Home</b>.</small>␀Show the rooms on the idle clock too␀␀␀␀<script>function haMore(){for(let k=0;k<6;k++){const r=document.getElementById('har'+k);if(r.style.display=='none'){r.style.display='';return}}}function haFind(){const m=document.getElementById('hamsg'),u=document.getElementById('haurl'),t=document.getElementById('hatoken');m.textContent='Asking Home Assistant...';fetch('/ha/find',{method:'POST',body:new URLSearchParams({url:u.value,token:t.value})}).then(r=>r.json()).then(j=>{if(j.err){m.textContent=j.err;return}if(j.url&&j.url!=u.value.replace(/\/+$/,''))u.value=j.url;const s=j.s||[],dt=document.getElementById('hadt'),dh=document.getElementById('hadh');dt.textContent='';dh.textContent='';for(const x of s){const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=x.e;o.label=x.n+' ('+x.v+(x.u||'')+')';(x.c=='t'?dt:dh).append(o)}const used=new Set([...document.querySelectorAll('.har input:not(.nm)')].map(i=>i.value).filter(Boolean)),g={};for(const x of s){if(used.has(x.e))continue;const k=x.e.replace(/_(temperature|humidity)(_\d+)?$/,'$2');if(!g[k]){let n=x.n.replace(/ (temperature|humidity)$/i,''),q=n,c=2;while(Object.values(g).some(v=>v.n==q))q=n+' '+c++;g[k]={n:q}}g[k][x.c]=x.e}let added=0;for(const k in g){for(let i=0;i<6;i++){const r=document.getElementById('har'+i),[n,a,b]=r.querySelectorAll('input');if(n.value||a.value||b.value)continue;n.value=g[k].n;a.value=g[k].t||'';b.value=g[k].h||'';r.style.display='';added++;break}}m.textContent=`Found ${j.nT} temperature and ${j.nH} humidity sensor${j.nH==1?'':'s'}.`+(added?` Filled in ${added} room${added>1?'s':''} below â€“ rename them if you like, then press Save.`:(s.length?' Pick them in the boxes below (tap a box for the list), then press Save.':''))}).catch(()=>m.textContent='No answer from the board.')}</script>␀␀spotify␀><summary>Spotify app details (one-time setup, needs Premium)</summary>␀<small>Put the relay page on GitHub Pages (or any https address you own), then at <b>developer.spotify.com/dashboard</b> &rarr; Create app &rarr; add that https address as the Redirect URI &rarr; tick <b>Web API</b> &rarr; Save. Copy the Client ID, Client secret and the same Redirect URI here, and save.</small>␀␀␀␀<label>Redirect URI (exactly as entered at Spotify)</label><input name='spredir' value='␀␀␀␀' autocapitalize='off' placeholder='https://yourname.github.io/spotify-callback/'>␀␀<label>Client ID</label><input name='spid' value='␀␀' autocapitalize='off' autocomplete='off'>␀␀<label>Client secret</label><input name='spsecret' type='text' class='secret' autocapitalize='off' autocomplete='off' spellcheck='false' placeholder='␀␀<a class='btnlink' href='␀␀␀'>Connect Spotify</a><small>Press Agree on Spotify's page and you'll be brought straight back here.</small><details><summary>The relay page showed a code instead?</summary><label>Paste the code or that page's full address</label><input name='url' placeholder='code or full address' autocapitalize='off'><button type='submit' class='b2' formaction='/spotify/code' formnovalidate>Use this code</button></details>␀␀<button type='submit' class='b2' formaction='/spotify/disconnect' formnovalidate>Disconnect Spotify</button>␀␀␀␀<small>Save the app details first; a <b>Connect Spotify</b> button then appears here.</small>␀␀␀Motion␀␀motion␀␀<small style='color:#e62117'>Motion sensor not detected.</small>␀␀␀␀Shake to refresh␀␀␀␀Face-down turns the screen off␀␀Stand it on its side for a tall leaderboard␀Tall leaderboard is upside down? Tick to flip it␀␀␀␀Double-tap the desk for the next channel␀␀␀␀<label>Desk tap sensitivity</label><select name='tapsens'>␀␀Low (firm knocks)␀␀␀Medium␀␀High (light taps)␀␀␀<label>Calibration</label><small>Put the board in the position you normally use it (on its stand or flat), then press:</small><button type='submit' class='b2' formaction='/calibrate' formnovalidate>Set this as the normal position</button>␀␀edit␀␀␀␀Wi-Fi networks␀␀wifi␀␀␀␀<small>The board joins your <b>Preferred</b> network when it's in range, otherwise the strongest saved one. <b>Connect now</b> switches straight away.</small><div class='st' style='margin:10px 0'>␀␀␀␀<label style='margin:4px 0 0'><input type='radio' name='pref' value='-1' style='width:auto'␀<div class='saved'><b>␀␀</b>␀␀␀␀<span style='color:#30d158'>connected</span>␀␀␀␀<button type='submit' formaction='/wifi/connect?n=␀␀' formnovalidate class='mini'>Connect now</button>␀␀<span>fixed IP</span>␀␀␀<label style='margin:0'><input type='radio' name='pref' value='␀' style='width:auto'␀␀␀␀> Preferred</label>␀<a href='/settings?edit=␀␀␀␀#wifi'>Edit</a>␀<label style='margin:0'><input type='checkbox' name='rm␀' value='1' style='width:auto'> Remove</label></div>␀␀␀␀> No preference (strongest signal wins)</label>␀<label>␀Editing: ␀␀␀Add another network (e.g. home)␀Wi-Fi network␀␀␀<button type='button' id='scanBtn' onclick='scan()' class='b2' style='margin-top:6px'>&#128246; Scan for networks</button>␀␀<div id='nets' style='margin:8px 0'></div>␀␀<input id='s' name='ssid' value='␀␀␀' placeholder='Network name (tap one above, or type it)'␀␀␀␀<small>Leave blank if you're not adding a network.</small>␀␀<label>Wi-Fi password</label>␀␀␀<input id='pw' name='pass' type='password' autocomplete='off' autocapitalize='off' placeholder='␀␀␀␀'><small><label style='display:inline;margin:0'><input type='checkbox' style='width:auto' onclick="document.getElementById('pw').type=this.checked?'text':'password'"> Show password</label></small>␀␀␀␀<label>Username (only for work Wi-Fi that asks for one)</label>␀<input name='user' value='␀␀' autocapitalize='off' placeholder='Leave blank for normal Wi-Fi'>␀␀><summary>Advanced settings for this network</summary>␀␀Compatibility mode (Wi-Fi 4 instead of Wi-Fi 6)␀<label>Fixed IP address (blank = automatic)</label>␀<input name='ip' value='␀␀␀␀' placeholder='e.g. 192.168.1.250' inputmode='decimal'>␀<label>Gateway (router) address</label>␀<input name='gw' value='␀␀␀␀' placeholder='e.g. 192.168.1.1' inputmode='decimal'>␀␀␀<label>Subnet mask</label>␀␀<input name='mask' value='␀␀' placeholder='255.255.255.0' inputmode='decimal'>␀␀<label>DNS server</label>␀␀␀<input name='dns' value='␀␀␀' placeholder='e.g. 8.8.8.8' inputmode='decimal'>␀␀␀<small>If this one doesn't answer, the board also tries 8.8.8.8.</small>␀␀␀␀Updates␀updates␀Check for updates at start-up (offers to install on the QR screen)␀␀Install new versions from GitHub automatically (at 3 am)␀␀␀␀<small>Either way the board checks once a day and shows when a new version is out; install it from the <a href='/update'>Update page</a>.</small>␀␀␀<details><summary>Update source (advanced)</summary><label>Address of the builds folder</label><input name='updurl' autocapitalize='off' value='␀␀␀␀'><small>Only change this if you build your own copy (a fork) on GitHub.</small></details>␀␀Security␀␀␀␀security␀␀␀␀<p class='ok'>PIN is on &#10003;</p>␀␀␀␀<small>No PIN set: anyone on your Wi-Fi can open this page and change things.</small>␀␀␀</label><input name='pin' type='password' inputmode='numeric' autocomplete='new-password' maxlength='12' placeholder='␀␀<label>Type it again</label><input name='pin2' type='password' inputmode='numeric' autocomplete='new-password' maxlength='12'>␀␀Remove the PIN␀␀<small>After you save, your browser asks for it whenever you open Settings or Update: user name <b>admin</b>, password = your PIN. The dashboard stays open to view. Forgotten it? Hold BOOT for 3 seconds: setup mode doesn't ask for it, so you can change it there.</small>␀␀<div class='savebar'><button type='submit'>Save &amp; restart</button></div>␀␀␀␀</form>␀Firmware␀␀␀␀firmware␀␀␀␀<p style='margin:0'>Running <b>v14.6</b> &middot; <a href='/update'>&#11014; Update</a>␀ &middot; <b style='color:#30d158'>v␀␀␀␀ available</b>␀␀Backup &amp; restore␀␀␀␀backup␀␀<small>Save all your settings to a file, e.g. before a full re-flash or to set up a second board. History and records stay on the board.</small><a class='btnlink' style='background:#2a2a2e' href='/backup'>&#11015; Download settings</a><small><a href='/backup?secrets=1'>Download including passwords, keys and sign-ins</a> â€“ keep that file private.</small><label>Restore from a file</label><input type='file' id='rf' accept='.json'><button type='button' class='b2' onclick='restore()'>Restore &amp; restart</button><small id='rm'></small><script>function restore(){const f=document.getElementById('rf').files[0],m=document.getElementById('rm');if(!f){m.textContent='Choose the .json file first.';return}f.text().then(t=>fetch('/restore',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:t})).then(r=>r.text()).then(t=>{m.textContent=t;setTimeout(()=>location.href='/',12000)}).catch(()=>m.textContent='Restore failed.')}</script>␀␀␀␀<small style='margin-top:16px'>Board Wi-Fi MAC address: ␀␀␀␀</small></div>␀␀<script>scan()</script>␀"v␀␀If-None-Match␀␀␀ETag␀␀␀␀no-cache␀␀␀␀Content-Encoding␀␀␀␀gzip␀␀␀␀i␀␀␀all-channels␀␀␀␀Content-Disposition␀attachment; filename="subcounter-␀␀␀.csv"␀␀␀text/csv␀␀␀␀channel,time_utc,subscribers
␀␀␀%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ␀␀",␀␀-with-keys␀␀secrets␀with_secrets␀␀␀␀nvs␀%02x␀␀␀␀attachment; filename="subcounter-settings␀␀␀.json"␀␀updatedAgo␀␀ver␀accent␀␀m0␀␀m1␀␀morning␀Â£␀␀$␀␀␀â‚¬␀cur␀lo␀␀hi␀␀race␀␀␀␀wx␀␀place␀␀␀temp␀␀␀␀feels␀␀␀text␀␀␀␀rainHour␀␀␀␀rainPct␀wind␀␀␀␀rooms␀␀␀Â°C␀,"channels":[␀␀␀handle␀␀subs␀␀␀␀step␀␀␀␀rate␀␀␀␀stepAt␀␀joined␀␀avatar␀␀statsOk␀d1␀␀d7␀␀d30␀histStart␀␀␀vw␀␀lv␀␀usual␀␀␀next␀␀␀␀prev␀␀␀␀vt␀␀ageMin␀␀typical␀at1h␀␀␀␀base1h␀␀at24h␀␀␀base24h␀cmp␀pts␀viewers␀thumb␀␀␀game␀␀␀␀mo␀␀lm␀␀lmFrom␀␀pb␀␀dayT␀␀␀␀week␀␀␀␀weekT␀␀␀vidT␀␀␀␀vidTitle␀␀␀␀cmOff␀␀␀rv␀␀dur␀likes␀␀␀]}␀␀,[␀␀days␀␀␀␀kind␀␀␀␀%lld␀␀␀␀Milestones␀␀Channel goes live␀␀␀New records (your channel)␀␀Overtakes in the race␀␀␀Your new video's view milestones␀␀␀␀Every new subscriber (your channel)␀Creators␀␀␀␀Device␀␀Summary␀part=snippet,statistics,contentDetails,liveStreamingDetails&fields=items(id,snippet(title,publishedAt,liveBroadcastContent),statistics(viewCount,likeCount,commentCount),contentDetails/duration,liveStreamingDetails/concurrentViewers)&id=␀␀␀␀items(id,snippet(title,publishedAt,country,thumbnails/default/url),statistics(subscriberCount,hiddenSubscriberCount,viewCount,videoCount),contentDetails/relatedPlaylists/uploads)␀␀Classic (gold)␀␀#ffc53d␀YouTube red␀#ff3b30␀Twitch purple␀␀␀#a48aff␀Ocean␀␀␀#33ccff␀Mint␀␀␀␀#3ddc97␀High contrast␀␀␀#ffe600␀starting␀␀␀␀Unknown operation id at %d: %d
␀1.2.11␀␀Description␀invalid distance too far back␀␀␀invalid distance code␀␀␀invalid literal/length code␀incorrect data check␀␀␀␀incorrect length check␀␀unknown header flags set␀␀␀␀unknown compression method␀␀incorrect header check␀␀invalid window size␀header crc mismatch␀invalid block type␀␀invalid stored block lengths␀␀␀␀too many length or distance symbols␀invalid code lengths set␀␀␀␀invalid code -- missing end-of-block␀␀␀␀invalid literal/lengths set␀invalid distances set␀␀␀invalid bit length repeat␀␀␀,CH:␀␀␀␀,OPEN␀␀␀,WEP␀␀␀␀,WPA_PSK␀␀␀␀,WPA2_PSK␀␀␀,WPA_WPA2_PSK␀␀␀,WEAP␀␀␀,WPA3_PSK␀␀␀,WPA2_WPA3_PSK␀␀,WAPI_PSK␀␀␀,OWE␀␀␀␀,WPA3_ENT_SUITE_B_192_BIT␀␀␀,STA:␀␀␀,RSSI:␀␀G␀␀␀LR␀␀,EAP␀␀␀␀UNSPECIFIED␀AUTH_EXPIRE␀AUTH_LEAVE␀␀ASSOC_EXPIRE␀␀␀␀ASSOC_TOOMANY␀␀␀NOT_AUTHED␀␀NOT_ASSOCED␀ASSOC_LEAVE␀ASSOC_NOT_AUTHED␀␀␀␀DISASSOC_PWRCAP_BAD␀DISASSOC_SUPCHAN_BAD␀␀␀␀BSS_TRANSITION_DISASSOC␀IE_INVALID␀␀MIC_FAILURE␀4WAY_HANDSHAKE_TIMEOUT␀␀GROUP_KEY_UPDATE_TIMEOUT␀␀␀␀IE_IN_4WAY_DIFFERS␀␀GROUP_CIPHER_INVALID␀␀␀␀PAIRWISE_CIPHER_INVALID␀AKMP_INVALID␀␀␀␀UNSUPP_RSN_IE_VERSION␀␀␀INVALID_RSN_IE_CAP␀␀802_1X_AUTH_FAILED␀␀CIPHER_SUITE_REJECTED␀␀␀TDLS_PEER_UNREACHABLE␀␀␀TDLS_UNSPECIFIED␀␀␀␀SSP_REQUESTED_DISASSOC␀␀NO_SSP_ROAMING_AGREEMENT␀␀␀␀BAD_CIPHER_OR_AKM␀␀␀NOT_AUTHORIZED_THIS_LOCATION␀␀␀␀SERVICE_CHANGE_PERCLUDES_TS␀UNSPECIFIED_QOS␀NOT_ENOUGH_BANDWIDTH␀␀␀␀MISSING_ACKS␀␀␀␀EXCEEDED_TXOP␀␀␀STA_LEAVING␀END_BA␀␀UNKNOWN_BA␀␀PEER_INITIATED␀␀AP_INITIATED␀␀␀␀INVALID_FT_ACTION_FRAME_COUNT␀␀␀INVALID_PMKID␀␀␀INVALID_MDE␀INVALID_FTE␀TRANSMISSION_LINK_ESTABLISH_FAILED␀␀ALTERATIVE_CHANNEL_OCCUPIED␀BEACON_TIMEOUT␀␀NO_AP_FOUND␀AUTH_FAIL␀␀␀ASSOC_FAIL␀␀HANDSHAKE_TIMEOUT␀␀␀CONNECTION_FAIL␀AP_TSF_RESET␀␀␀␀ROAMING␀ASSOC_COMEBACK_TIME_TOO_LONG␀␀␀␀arduino_events␀␀vector::_M_realloc_insert␀␀␀vector::_M_realloc_append␀␀␀ <UP␀␀␀␀ <DOWN␀␀DHCPC␀␀␀_OFF␀␀␀␀DHCPS␀␀␀,AUTOUP␀,GARP␀␀␀,IP_MOD␀,PPP␀␀␀␀,BRIDGE␀,V6_REP␀ PRIO: ␀      ␀␀ether ␀␀inet ␀␀␀ netmask ␀␀␀ broadcast ␀gateway ␀␀␀␀ dns ␀␀␀inet6 ␀␀ type ␀␀GLOBAL␀␀LINK_LOCAL␀␀SITE_LO